  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">教育研修(外部)受講者数</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
